          "text": "Lino langaula akati kabantu, ujane bantu bacenjede bayoowa Leza, bantu basyomeka basulide masinkamulomo, ubabike babe basilutwe bazyuulu abasilutwe bamyanda abasilutwe bamakumi osanwe abasilutwe bamakumi. ",
