          "text": "Lino aba bantu bayoobeteka bantu ciindi coonse, Makani aakataazya bayooaleta kulinduwe, pele makani maniini buyo bayooakosola beni, Kucita obo kuyookuubila, nkaambo bayookugwasya kunyampula mikuli. ",
